== release-runner.md (0644)
---
name: release-runner
description: 'Runs the release checklist and fixes what fails.'
tools:
  - run_command
  - manage_task
  - view_file
  - replace_file_content
  - write_to_file
preloadSkills:
  - changelog-style
mainAgent: false
---
Run the release checklist in order. Stop at the first failure, fix it, and run the step again.
